        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 223,
        "headingId": 779,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> aggregates of mature adipocytes at the level of the papillary and upper reticular dermis; dermal connective tissue changes.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-24T16:39:16"
      }
    ],
